## Erlang node name. Defaults to `macula_station' for single-host
## deployments (CT, dev). When two or more stations share an EPMD
## (e.g. `network_mode: host' with multiple containers per box),
## the operator sets `MACULA_NODE_NAME=macula_station_<city>' in
## the container env so each station registers a distinct short
## name with the shared EPMD.
##
## `${VAR:-default}' substitution requires
## `{relx, [..., {vm_args_src_replacements, [...]}]}' but rebar3 +
## relx do `os.env' substitution on this file at boot when
## `RELX_REPLACE_OS_VARS=true' is set in the container env (see
## Dockerfile).
-sname ${MACULA_NODE_NAME}
-setcookie macula_station_dev_cookie
+K true
+A 64
+sbt db
